1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:02,040
(All people, incidents,
and backgrounds...)

2
00:00:02,110 --> 00:00:03,270
(in this drama are fictitious
and unrelated to reality.)

3
00:00:03,340 --> 00:00:05,210
(Also, children were filmed
under production guidelines.)

4
00:00:06,640 --> 00:00:07,910
(Episode 96)

5
00:00:14,850 --> 00:00:17,620
Help... Help me.

6
00:00:49,720 --> 00:00:50,720
What brings you here?

7
00:00:52,660 --> 00:00:56,330
I have a gift for my son,
who's set to inherit...

8
00:00:57,300 --> 00:00:58,760
the Adele Group from me.

9
00:00:59,330 --> 00:01:00,330
A gift?

10
00:01:10,810 --> 00:01:14,610
I wore this when I became
the chairman of the Adele Group.

11
00:01:14,950 --> 00:01:17,780
You'll be elected chairman today,
so wear it.

12
00:01:18,380 --> 00:01:20,250
I'm giving you what's mine,

13
00:01:20,750 --> 00:01:23,390
so when you pass it down
to your son,

14
00:01:23,990 --> 00:01:25,720
you can make it a tradition...

15
00:01:27,930 --> 00:01:29,160
for the Adele family.

16
00:01:56,750 --> 00:01:59,860
There you go.
The tie pin suits you well.

17
00:02:01,530 --> 00:02:03,130
You look the part of my son,

18
00:02:03,190 --> 00:02:05,300
the next chairman
of the Adele Group.

19
00:02:05,530 --> 00:02:09,170
He's right.
Our son looks so handsome today.

20
00:02:10,570 --> 00:02:13,140
Don't forget you have me to thank
when you become chairman.

21
00:02:14,310 --> 00:02:15,310
When I become chairman?

22
00:02:16,240 --> 00:02:17,880
What makes you so sure I'll win?

23
00:02:19,410 --> 00:02:20,410
Well...

24
00:02:22,210 --> 00:02:23,820
The chairman has more shares,
doesn't he?

25
00:02:23,950 --> 00:02:25,550
Father may have a lot of shares,

26
00:02:26,220 --> 00:02:27,990
but they must've gathered a lot
on their side too.

27
00:02:30,020 --> 00:02:31,260
Aren't you two worried?

28
00:02:33,530 --> 00:02:34,990
If you're well-prepared,

29
00:02:35,530 --> 00:02:37,460
there's no need to worry.

30
00:02:37,530 --> 00:02:41,270
That's right.
You are definitely winning today.

31
00:02:41,630 --> 00:02:43,270
All right, let's get going then.

32
00:02:43,700 --> 00:02:44,700
Let's go.

33
00:02:58,780 --> 00:02:59,820
You must be nervous.

34
00:03:00,350 --> 00:03:01,750
Yes, a little.

35
00:03:02,190 --> 00:03:03,320
There's nothing to be nervous about.

36
00:03:03,960 --> 00:03:06,620
Both sides have
about the same number of shares,

37
00:03:07,530 --> 00:03:09,360
and we have a winning card
up our sleeve.

38
00:03:10,900 --> 00:03:12,900
That's right.
You're going to become...

39
00:03:13,100 --> 00:03:15,070
the chairman of the Adele Group.

40
00:03:15,730 --> 00:03:18,400
And we're going to take away
what Park Tae Ho cherishes more...

41
00:03:18,900 --> 00:03:20,440
than his life.

42
00:03:21,570 --> 00:03:23,980
With that power,
we will bring him down.

43
00:03:29,250 --> 00:03:30,680
(Extraordinary General Meeting
of Shareholders)

44
00:03:30,750 --> 00:03:31,920
(Kim Dan Hui)

45
00:03:31,950 --> 00:03:32,950
(Baek Jin Ju)

46
00:03:33,080 --> 00:03:34,120
(Ballot Box)

47
00:03:37,590 --> 00:03:39,420
- Hello, sir.
- Hey.

48
00:03:52,570 --> 00:03:54,870
(Extraordinary General Meeting
of Shareholders)

49
00:03:54,870 --> 00:03:57,180
(New Chairman Election)

50
00:04:04,480 --> 00:04:07,850
How dare you show
your shameless faces here?

51
00:04:08,850 --> 00:04:11,720
Trying to steal Adele
with the shares I gave you?

52
00:04:12,960 --> 00:04:15,160
How dare you unqualified nobodies
think you deserve this?

53
00:04:18,500 --> 00:04:20,230
You'll deeply regret this today.

54
00:04:21,770 --> 00:04:25,140
For setting a trap for me
and throwing me in a cell,

55
00:04:26,600 --> 00:04:28,010
I'll make you pay.

56
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:31,540
Fine. Go ahead and try.

57
00:04:31,880 --> 00:04:33,540
As for who's unqualified,

58
00:04:34,210 --> 00:04:35,610
the shareholders will decide.

59
00:04:35,880 --> 00:04:37,980
Are you saying
Hyun Jun is unqualified?

60
00:04:38,980 --> 00:04:40,950
No matter what anyone says,
the heir to the Adele Group...

61
00:04:41,390 --> 00:04:42,620
is our Hyun Jun.

62
00:04:43,620 --> 00:04:44,620
The heir?

63
00:04:47,260 --> 00:04:48,930
Stop your nonsense
and stay out of it.

64
00:04:49,530 --> 00:04:52,300
Park Hyun Jun,
are you really okay with this?

65
00:04:52,400 --> 00:04:53,600
Of course I'm not.

66
00:04:54,400 --> 00:04:56,000
In fact, I'm very uncomfortable.

67
00:04:56,970 --> 00:05:00,710
- Because of you and Baek Jin Ju.
- Yes, so uncomfortable...

68
00:05:01,970 --> 00:05:03,240
that I want to get rid of you both.

69
00:05:10,850 --> 00:05:14,120
The Adele Group extraordinary
shareholders' meeting...

70
00:05:14,350 --> 00:05:15,450
will now come to order.

71
00:05:15,790 --> 00:05:16,790
Today's agenda...

72
00:05:17,160 --> 00:05:19,920
is the election
of the new chairman and CEO.

73
00:05:20,360 --> 00:05:21,490
Right.

74
00:05:21,830 --> 00:05:25,060
It's a simple matter,
so let's get to the vote.

75
00:05:25,630 --> 00:05:26,630
Chop-chop.

76
00:05:32,340 --> 00:05:33,910
(Extraordinary General Meeting
of Shareholders)

77
00:05:37,510 --> 00:05:39,240
You didn't bring
the slush fund ledger, I see.

78
00:05:40,140 --> 00:05:42,950
Just you watch.
I'll make sure that Park Hyun Jun...

79
00:05:43,350 --> 00:05:44,650
never becomes chairman.

80
00:05:44,980 --> 00:05:46,080
We'll see.

81
00:05:46,420 --> 00:05:49,450
You'd be wise to keep
Hyun Jun's secret under wraps.

82
00:05:50,350 --> 00:05:52,360
I'm pretty sure
you'll be needing my help.

83
00:05:53,320 --> 00:05:54,390
What are you talking about?

84
00:05:54,590 --> 00:05:55,660
Just wait.

85
00:05:56,590 --> 00:05:58,230
You'll find out soon enough.

86
00:06:01,830 --> 00:06:03,770
(New Chairman Election)

87
00:06:17,180 --> 00:06:18,880
The suspect's prints were
on the weapon.

88
00:06:19,180 --> 00:06:21,050
Really? Who's the suspect?

89
00:06:29,260 --> 00:06:31,530
All right, then. For the election
of the new chairman,

90
00:06:31,700 --> 00:06:33,660
we will now proceed with the vote.

91
00:06:34,030 --> 00:06:36,500
The candidates for chairman
are Park Hyun Jun...

92
00:06:36,730 --> 00:06:38,970
and Baek Jin Ju.

93
00:06:47,880 --> 00:06:49,250
(Extraordinary General Meeting
of Shareholders)

94
00:06:54,990 --> 00:06:56,620
(Chairman candidate, Baek Jin Ju)

95
00:07:06,530 --> 00:07:08,000
(New Chairman Election)

96
00:07:08,100 --> 00:07:10,100
(Seoul Central District Court)

97
00:07:12,870 --> 00:07:14,140
(Chairman candidate, Baek Jin Ju)

98
00:07:18,640 --> 00:07:19,980
(Official Order, Courts of Korea)

99
00:07:23,480 --> 00:07:24,880
(Chairman candidate, Baek Jin Ju)

100
00:07:26,780 --> 00:07:28,990
Shareholders, there's something...

101
00:07:29,450 --> 00:07:31,060
I need to tell you.

102
00:07:31,860 --> 00:07:35,390
I reported Park Tae Ho's
illegal activities to the court,

103
00:07:36,030 --> 00:07:37,360
and as a result...

104
00:07:37,600 --> 00:07:38,760
(Official Order, Courts of Korea)

105
00:07:38,830 --> 00:07:41,930
He has been prohibited
from exercising his voting rights.

106
00:07:44,740 --> 00:07:45,740
Wait, what?

107
00:07:45,800 --> 00:07:48,010
I'm prohibited from exercising
my voting rights?

108
00:07:48,770 --> 00:07:52,080
Therefore,
at today's shareholders' meeting,

109
00:07:52,410 --> 00:07:54,280
in regard to the chairman election,

110
00:07:56,010 --> 00:07:57,920
Park Tae Ho can't exercise
his voting rights.

111
00:07:58,020 --> 00:07:59,050
What the...

112
00:08:00,480 --> 00:08:01,850
What are you talking about?

113
00:08:02,950 --> 00:08:04,060
Park Tae Ho...

114
00:08:04,460 --> 00:08:07,360
can't vote in the chairman election.

115
00:08:08,290 --> 00:08:09,290
Says who?

116
00:08:09,930 --> 00:08:10,930
Who says so?

117
00:08:11,660 --> 00:08:12,660
Says who?

118
00:08:13,300 --> 00:08:16,730
- What are you talking about?
- Kim Dan Hui's petty tricks...

119
00:08:16,800 --> 00:08:18,270
If he can't vote,

120
00:08:19,070 --> 00:08:20,340
- we'll lose.
- Quiet!

121
00:08:20,400 --> 00:08:21,410
No.

122
00:08:22,440 --> 00:08:24,110
We're definitely going to win today.

123
00:08:25,640 --> 00:08:27,080
What are you talking about?

124
00:08:29,080 --> 00:08:30,720
Everyone, please be quiet.

125
00:08:31,250 --> 00:08:33,050
In accordance with
the court's decision,

126
00:08:33,320 --> 00:08:35,290
shareholder Park Tae Ho's
voting rights are restricted.

127
00:08:35,290 --> 00:08:38,960
Therefore,
among the remaining shareholders,

128
00:08:39,260 --> 00:08:40,490
we will now proceed with the vote.

129
00:08:40,590 --> 00:08:41,990
For crying out loud.

130
00:08:47,400 --> 00:08:48,400
Looks like she'll be elected.

131
00:08:57,940 --> 00:08:59,040
Are you that happy?

132
00:08:59,510 --> 00:09:02,710
My Jin Ju is becoming chairman.
Of course I'm happy.

133
00:09:03,580 --> 00:09:07,180
I'm so proud of her
for overcoming so much to get here.

134
00:09:07,690 --> 00:09:12,190
I'm also glad we're taking away
the immense power Park Tae Ho held.

135
00:09:12,890 --> 00:09:14,890
Only good things
are ahead for her now.

136
00:09:15,260 --> 00:09:16,260
Of course.

137
00:09:16,690 --> 00:09:18,500
Once my Jin Ju becomes chairman,

138
00:09:19,100 --> 00:09:20,670
Park Tae Ho will start to crumble.

139
00:09:21,600 --> 00:09:22,600
And then...

140
00:09:22,870 --> 00:09:24,140
My goodness!

141
00:09:24,840 --> 00:09:25,840
What was that?

142
00:09:26,400 --> 00:09:27,610
James, are you okay?

143
00:09:28,170 --> 00:09:29,770
Yes, I'm fine, but...

144
00:09:33,680 --> 00:09:34,850
The bouquet...

145
00:09:38,880 --> 00:09:41,350
Wait, wasn't that the police?

146
00:09:42,050 --> 00:09:44,220
They were.
I wonder what that's about.

147
00:09:44,860 --> 00:09:46,520
They seemed to be heading that way.

148
00:09:46,860 --> 00:09:48,160
But over there...

149
00:09:48,830 --> 00:09:50,660
Isn't that where
the shareholders' meeting is?

150
00:09:54,130 --> 00:09:56,730
I will now announce
the results of the vote.

151
00:09:57,230 --> 00:09:58,500
After tallying the votes,

152
00:09:58,840 --> 00:10:01,710
- Baek Jin Ju is...
- Ms. Baek Jin Ju!

153
00:10:02,170 --> 00:10:03,570
(Seo Hyeon Cheol, Choi Yu Na)

154
00:10:04,310 --> 00:10:05,310
What's going on?

155
00:10:12,880 --> 00:10:14,150
Are you Baek Jin Ju?

156
00:10:14,720 --> 00:10:17,490
Yes. I'm Baek Jin Ju.

157
00:10:18,120 --> 00:10:19,320
What is this about?

158
00:10:19,590 --> 00:10:22,330
Regarding the attempted murder
of Yun Hyeong Su,

159
00:10:22,390 --> 00:10:24,500
- you're under emergency arrest.
- What?

160
00:10:26,200 --> 00:10:28,000
Attempted murder?

161
00:10:35,540 --> 00:10:37,380
Yun Hyeong Su?
Isn't he with the police?

162
00:10:38,680 --> 00:10:40,040
You mean Deputy Chief Yun?

163
00:10:40,950 --> 00:10:41,950
Wait a minute.

164
00:10:44,020 --> 00:10:45,780
This is ridiculous.

165
00:10:45,820 --> 00:10:48,820
That's right.
There must be some kind of mistake.

166
00:10:48,890 --> 00:10:51,490
We identified
Baek Jin Ju's fingerprints...

167
00:10:51,520 --> 00:10:53,620
on the weapon used in the crime.

168
00:10:53,960 --> 00:10:54,960
That's impossible.

169
00:10:55,030 --> 00:10:57,800
You have the right to an attorney
and the right to remain silent.

170
00:10:57,860 --> 00:11:01,200
Anything you say from this moment
can be used as evidence.

171
00:11:02,830 --> 00:11:07,810
No way. This is all a mistake.
It wasn't me.

172
00:11:10,980 --> 00:11:13,580
(Park Tae Ho)

173
00:11:19,950 --> 00:11:22,690
Actually, I have a pretty good idea.

174
00:11:23,620 --> 00:11:25,120
If we use Deputy Chief Yun,

175
00:11:25,190 --> 00:11:27,290
we can win
at the shareholders' meeting.

176
00:11:28,890 --> 00:11:31,730
What exactly is this idea of yours?

177
00:11:31,800 --> 00:11:33,530
We kill Deputy Chief Yun,

178
00:11:33,630 --> 00:11:35,930
and we frame Baek Jin Ju
as the murderer.

179
00:11:38,500 --> 00:11:40,670
Deputy Chief Yun and Baek Jin Ju.

180
00:11:41,670 --> 00:11:42,870
Get rid of them all at once?

181
00:11:43,110 --> 00:11:44,940
Yes. That's right.

182
00:11:45,180 --> 00:11:47,480
Furious that her police investigation
was blocked,

183
00:11:47,550 --> 00:11:50,450
Baek Jin Ju held a grudge
and killed Deputy Chief Yun.

184
00:11:50,850 --> 00:11:53,680
That way, we can get rid of
the troublesome Deputy Chief Yun,

185
00:11:54,220 --> 00:11:57,620
and we can also remove Baek Jin Ju
as a chairman candidate.

186
00:11:58,590 --> 00:11:59,690
Wait.

187
00:11:59,760 --> 00:12:02,390
We can take care
of two nuisances at once?

188
00:12:03,230 --> 00:12:04,600
All right. Then...

189
00:12:05,300 --> 00:12:07,630
as for Deputy Chief Yun,
you'll take care of him...

190
00:12:08,270 --> 00:12:09,270
yourself.

191
00:12:09,900 --> 00:12:10,900
What?

192
00:12:11,540 --> 00:12:12,540
Me?

193
00:12:13,270 --> 00:12:16,940
From your failure to deal
with Baek Jin Ju seven years ago...

194
00:12:17,010 --> 00:12:20,580
to your mistake of losing
your father's shares to her,

195
00:12:21,550 --> 00:12:22,550
make up for all of it.

196
00:12:23,910 --> 00:12:25,880
That's the only way
you can stand by Hyun Jun's side...

197
00:12:26,550 --> 00:12:28,250
as part of the Adele family...

198
00:12:29,350 --> 00:12:30,650
and be truly accepted.

199
00:13:04,090 --> 00:13:05,990
Baek Jin Ju will be here soon.

200
00:13:06,420 --> 00:13:08,760
While you're dealing
with Deputy Chief Yun,

201
00:13:08,830 --> 00:13:10,290
I'll be keeping her busy.

202
00:13:11,900 --> 00:13:13,530
Later, when the police
begin their investigation,

203
00:13:13,600 --> 00:13:15,470
it'll be hard for her
to prove her alibi.

204
00:13:15,600 --> 00:13:17,940
It'll be like I never met
with Baek Jin Ju,

205
00:13:18,640 --> 00:13:19,740
and we'll make it look like...

206
00:13:20,800 --> 00:13:23,710
she was at the Adele Warehouse
at the time of the murder.

207
00:13:42,860 --> 00:13:44,830
All I have to do is plant
Baek Jin Ju's fingerprints,

208
00:13:45,300 --> 00:13:46,530
and it'll all be over.

209
00:13:47,900 --> 00:13:49,470
If I can show them...

210
00:13:49,870 --> 00:13:52,200
I got rid of Deputy Chief Yun
and even Baek Jin Ju,

211
00:13:53,000 --> 00:13:55,410
if I can make
Park Hyun Jun the chairman,

212
00:13:58,910 --> 00:14:01,080
I'll truly become
part of the Adele family.

213
00:14:10,620 --> 00:14:11,620
Choi Yu Na.

214
00:14:12,160 --> 00:14:14,020
This was all your doing, wasn't it?

215
00:14:18,060 --> 00:14:19,130
Baek Jin Ju.

216
00:14:21,130 --> 00:14:25,070
You really need
to stop blaming other people.

217
00:14:25,770 --> 00:14:28,210
You blamed Deputy Chief Yun
for interfering...

218
00:14:28,510 --> 00:14:30,170
with the police investigation,

219
00:14:30,240 --> 00:14:32,280
saying that's how Chairman Park
was released.

220
00:14:32,940 --> 00:14:34,580
Is this what you've resorted to?

221
00:14:36,280 --> 00:14:37,680
I can't believe you.

222
00:14:38,020 --> 00:14:39,620
How could you try...

223
00:14:40,850 --> 00:14:42,120
to kill someone?

224
00:14:42,220 --> 00:14:43,350
Choi Yu Na!

225
00:14:43,950 --> 00:14:45,020
You...

226
00:14:45,190 --> 00:14:46,990
How could you do this,
right to the end?

227
00:14:47,160 --> 00:14:48,890
Who are you trying to frame?

228
00:14:48,960 --> 00:14:51,830
What Choi Yu Na is saying
is a baseless accusation.

229
00:14:53,100 --> 00:14:54,230
It's a trap.

230
00:14:54,530 --> 00:14:57,670
We'll determine that at the station.

231
00:14:58,740 --> 00:14:59,770
Let's go.

232
00:15:01,870 --> 00:15:03,370
It really wasn't me.

233
00:15:03,440 --> 00:15:06,480
I didn't hurt anyone.
This is all a setup.

234
00:15:06,540 --> 00:15:08,850
Jin Ju!

235
00:15:11,380 --> 00:15:12,520
- Hyun Jun!
- Hey.

236
00:15:15,020 --> 00:15:16,020
Where are you going?

237
00:15:16,090 --> 00:15:18,920
You're about to become
the chairman of Adele Group.

238
00:15:19,460 --> 00:15:22,030
All right, then. Moderator.

239
00:15:22,590 --> 00:15:25,730
It appears one of the candidates
has been disqualified,

240
00:15:26,130 --> 00:15:27,330
so let's vote again.

241
00:15:27,460 --> 00:15:30,300
- Again!
- Let's vote!

242
00:15:30,430 --> 00:15:32,570
- Let's do it.
- Yes, let's vote again.

243
00:15:32,640 --> 00:15:33,700
Let's vote!

244
00:15:35,370 --> 00:15:36,970
Voting has already ended.

245
00:15:37,710 --> 00:15:39,110
Please announce the results.

246
00:15:39,910 --> 00:15:43,380
Candidate Baek Jin Ju's innocence
will be proven.

247
00:15:44,250 --> 00:15:46,350
What? Innocence?

248
00:15:46,880 --> 00:15:49,820
A criminal whose fingerprints
were found on the weapon...

249
00:15:49,890 --> 00:15:51,490
is disqualified.

250
00:15:52,690 --> 00:15:56,590
Let's just hold a vote
on my son, Park Hyun Jun.

251
00:15:56,660 --> 00:15:58,300
Whether you're for or against him,

252
00:15:58,930 --> 00:16:00,700
let's proceed with that.

253
00:16:00,800 --> 00:16:02,070
Let's decide.

254
00:16:02,130 --> 00:16:04,270
- Come on, let's vote.
- Yes, let's do it.

255
00:16:04,340 --> 00:16:05,470
- Let's vote.
- Vote!

256
00:16:07,100 --> 00:16:09,040
- Let's do it.
- Come on.

257
00:16:09,110 --> 00:16:10,110
Let's vote!

258
00:16:11,110 --> 00:16:12,310
Let's vote again.

259
00:16:15,350 --> 00:16:16,450
Everyone,

260
00:16:16,950 --> 00:16:20,220
Park Hyun Jun is not qualified
to be chairman.

261
00:16:21,690 --> 00:16:22,820
What did you say?

262
00:16:22,990 --> 00:16:24,220
Not qualified?

263
00:16:24,220 --> 00:16:25,890
What is this nonsense?

264
00:16:26,590 --> 00:16:28,460
(Extraordinary General Meeting
of Shareholders)

265
00:16:29,830 --> 00:16:31,030
I told you...

266
00:16:31,460 --> 00:16:33,530
you'd be needing my help.

267
00:16:34,870 --> 00:16:36,530
If you want to clear
Baek Jin Ju's name,

268
00:16:37,430 --> 00:16:39,040
you're going to need my help.

269
00:16:39,370 --> 00:16:42,540
- What?
- If you expose Hyun Jun's secret,

270
00:16:43,310 --> 00:16:45,080
Baek Jin Ju is finished too.

271
00:16:51,220 --> 00:16:54,250
Hey. Wait a minute.
Jin Ju! Just a second!

272
00:16:54,620 --> 00:16:55,920
Jin Ju, what's going on?

273
00:16:55,990 --> 00:16:58,160
James, I think I've been framed.

274
00:16:58,160 --> 00:16:59,160
What?

275
00:16:59,220 --> 00:17:00,960
- Excuse me, just a moment.
- What?

276
00:17:00,960 --> 00:17:03,330
- Jin Ju.
- Hey, what is all this?

277
00:17:03,530 --> 00:17:05,760
Jin Ju has been framed
for attempted murder.

278
00:17:06,030 --> 00:17:07,230
Attempted murder?

279
00:17:07,400 --> 00:17:08,770
We can talk about the details later.

280
00:17:08,830 --> 00:17:10,600
I have to get
to the police station first.

281
00:17:10,900 --> 00:17:11,900
Jin Ju.

282
00:17:12,300 --> 00:17:14,140
I think we should go with them.

283
00:17:15,170 --> 00:17:18,080
What's going on? Jin Ju!

284
00:17:18,840 --> 00:17:19,840
Then,

285
00:17:19,910 --> 00:17:22,650
I will now announce
the results of the vote.

286
00:17:24,110 --> 00:17:25,350
According to the final tally,

287
00:17:25,620 --> 00:17:29,590
candidate Park Hyun Jun has been
elected as the new chairman.

288
00:17:30,250 --> 00:17:31,360
I hereby declare it.

289
00:17:34,630 --> 00:17:35,930
Yes!

290
00:17:36,830 --> 00:17:37,830
Hey!

291
00:17:53,510 --> 00:17:55,210
Don't think you've won.

292
00:17:55,710 --> 00:17:57,780
When Jin Ju's innocence is proven...

293
00:17:58,480 --> 00:18:00,420
and your evil deeds are exposed,

294
00:18:01,290 --> 00:18:02,320
that seat...

295
00:18:03,150 --> 00:18:04,960
will be hard to hold on to.

296
00:18:11,660 --> 00:18:14,030
Another round of applause!

297
00:18:17,370 --> 00:18:18,870
Let's hear it!

298
00:18:23,970 --> 00:18:27,640
I didn't harm Yun Hyeong Su.

299
00:18:27,710 --> 00:18:30,280
Your fingerprints were found
on the weapon.

300
00:18:30,350 --> 00:18:32,380
I really don't know anything
about this.

301
00:18:32,450 --> 00:18:33,780
You believed Deputy Chief Yun...

302
00:18:34,050 --> 00:18:36,490
was obstructing the reinvestigation
of your father's case.

303
00:18:36,720 --> 00:18:38,390
Is that why you held a grudge?

304
00:18:40,590 --> 00:18:44,060
My father was wrongfully murdered.

305
00:18:44,800 --> 00:18:48,600
I put my entire life on the line
to bring his killer to justice.

306
00:18:48,970 --> 00:18:51,670
How could I possibly kill someone?

307
00:18:52,840 --> 00:18:53,840
It's absurd.

308
00:18:53,900 --> 00:18:55,210
Then I'll ask you one more time.

309
00:18:55,810 --> 00:18:58,380
The incident occurred last night
around 8 p.m.

310
00:18:59,040 --> 00:19:00,640
Where were you at that time?

311
00:19:00,740 --> 00:19:01,810
Oh Jung Ran.

312
00:19:02,650 --> 00:19:04,620
I was meeting with Adele's
President Oh Jung Ran...

313
00:19:07,320 --> 00:19:10,220
Why did you suddenly ask to see me?

314
00:19:10,490 --> 00:19:12,390
Come to think of it,

315
00:19:12,690 --> 00:19:15,430
I met you as Chloe, and you
turned out to be Baek Jin Ju,

316
00:19:15,730 --> 00:19:17,930
and I never got to properly
confront you about it.

317
00:19:19,230 --> 00:19:20,360
Could it be...

318
00:19:21,130 --> 00:19:22,900
Did she lure me there on purpose?

319
00:19:23,300 --> 00:19:24,840
What are you talking about?

320
00:19:26,670 --> 00:19:28,010
At that time,

321
00:19:28,640 --> 00:19:31,070
I was meeting with Adele's
President Oh Jung Ran.

322
00:19:31,170 --> 00:19:33,940
You can check the restaurant's
security cameras or ask the staff.

323
00:19:34,010 --> 00:19:35,610
Where did this meeting take place?

324
00:19:39,180 --> 00:19:41,290
- Sure.
- Mother.

325
00:19:41,350 --> 00:19:42,350
What about Jin Ju?

326
00:19:42,520 --> 00:19:44,990
She's being questioned,
so we aren't allowed to see her.

327
00:19:45,090 --> 00:19:46,690
They said her lawyer can see her,

328
00:19:46,760 --> 00:19:48,990
so I've called a lawyer
from our company's legal team.

329
00:19:49,730 --> 00:19:51,730
Who do you think set this trap?

330
00:19:52,400 --> 00:19:54,460
Park Tae Ho? Oh Jung Ran?

331
00:19:54,530 --> 00:19:56,500
Or Choi Yu Na?

332
00:19:56,700 --> 00:19:58,400
It could be all three of them.

333
00:19:59,340 --> 00:20:02,940
To make Park Hyun Jun the chairman,
they targeted Jin Ju.

334
00:20:06,380 --> 00:20:07,380
Jin Ju.

335
00:20:07,780 --> 00:20:09,410
- Jin Ju!
- Jin Ju?

336
00:20:10,910 --> 00:20:13,080
- Jin Ju, are you okay?
- How are you holding up?

337
00:20:13,150 --> 00:20:15,190
Just hang in there.
You've been framed,

338
00:20:15,250 --> 00:20:16,650
so we just need to reveal the truth.

339
00:20:16,820 --> 00:20:19,220
Right. I called
the company's legal team,

340
00:20:19,690 --> 00:20:20,760
so don't worry.

341
00:20:21,220 --> 00:20:23,130
Yes, I'm okay.

342
00:20:23,590 --> 00:20:25,600
What happened
at the shareholders' meeting?

343
00:20:27,030 --> 00:20:29,030
Park Hyun Jun became the chairman.

344
00:20:29,670 --> 00:20:32,100
I felt like Oh Jung Ran
had something to say,

345
00:20:32,400 --> 00:20:34,240
so I didn't expose
Hyun Jun's secret for now.

346
00:20:34,300 --> 00:20:37,870
I was with her
when the incident happened.

347
00:20:37,940 --> 00:20:40,740
Okay, I'll go see her.

348
00:20:41,210 --> 00:20:45,020
I'll find a way to get you out,
so don't worry and wait.

349
00:20:45,080 --> 00:20:47,150
Sure. Don't worry about me.

350
00:20:49,250 --> 00:20:50,250
Jin Ju.

351
00:20:51,820 --> 00:20:54,420
Please take good care of James.

352
00:20:54,490 --> 00:20:56,630
Of course, don't worry.

353
00:20:56,830 --> 00:20:58,700
I'll stay by his side
and take good care of him.

354
00:20:59,730 --> 00:21:01,030
All right, that's enough.

355
00:21:01,100 --> 00:21:02,100
Let's wrap it up.

356
00:21:02,200 --> 00:21:03,800
- Come on.
- Don't worry.

357
00:21:04,130 --> 00:21:05,540
Jin Ju.

358
00:21:08,070 --> 00:21:10,410
- Jin Ju, my gosh.
- Be careful.

359
00:21:16,080 --> 00:21:17,910
I'll never forgive them.

360
00:21:20,250 --> 00:21:21,280
Min Jun.

361
00:21:27,120 --> 00:21:29,990
Hyun Jun became the chairman
of Adele Group.

362
00:21:30,260 --> 00:21:35,170
If Deputy Chief Yun dies,
will I become a murderer?

363
00:21:35,900 --> 00:21:38,970
Now that Park Tae Ho's
regained control of Adele Group,

364
00:21:39,670 --> 00:21:43,010
can I ever clear my name
and get out of here?

365
00:21:45,780 --> 00:21:46,780
No...

366
00:21:48,210 --> 00:21:49,980
I can't afford to be weak.

367
00:21:52,080 --> 00:21:53,850
Everyone is fighting for me
on the outside.

368
00:21:55,090 --> 00:21:59,460
From in here,
I have to find a way too.

369
00:22:09,970 --> 00:22:14,170
Kim Dan Hui, Baek Jin Ju,
and even Moon Tae Jin.

370
00:22:14,940 --> 00:22:18,040
How dare they covet Adele Group?

371
00:22:18,580 --> 00:22:20,040
Not a chance.

372
00:22:21,080 --> 00:22:23,010
They laughed at me for being alone.

373
00:22:23,080 --> 00:22:24,450
What a joke.

374
00:22:25,250 --> 00:22:30,020
I rallied my own people
and won for all to see.

375
00:22:30,190 --> 00:22:31,490
Of course.

376
00:22:31,520 --> 00:22:34,190
I mean, you have our Hyun Jun.

377
00:22:34,420 --> 00:22:35,790
And you have me too.

378
00:22:35,930 --> 00:22:39,000
Do you accept me
as your daughter-in-law now?

379
00:22:39,000 --> 00:22:40,060
We'll see.

380
00:22:40,800 --> 00:22:42,400
I told you to frame her for murder,

381
00:22:42,470 --> 00:22:44,230
but it only ended up
as attempted murder.

382
00:22:45,400 --> 00:22:49,610
You couldn't even finish off
Deputy Chief Yun.

383
00:22:50,770 --> 00:22:53,480
But the outcome is the same.

384
00:22:54,010 --> 00:22:56,010
Baek Jin Ju was dragged away
by the police,

385
00:22:56,710 --> 00:22:59,350
and Hyun Jun became the chairman.

386
00:23:00,550 --> 00:23:03,420
If Deputy Chief Yun wakes up,
it'll be a real headache.

387
00:23:03,890 --> 00:23:05,620
Keep checking on his condition.

388
00:23:06,420 --> 00:23:08,360
If it looks like
there might be a problem,

389
00:23:08,960 --> 00:23:10,230
finish the job.

390
00:23:17,530 --> 00:23:18,800
What's with you?

391
00:23:19,700 --> 00:23:20,700
What is it?

392
00:23:21,710 --> 00:23:24,910
Are you upset that I took
Baek Jin Ju out of the picture?

393
00:23:25,680 --> 00:23:28,180
Don't tell me you still...

394
00:23:29,110 --> 00:23:30,480
have feelings for that girl.

395
00:23:30,710 --> 00:23:32,150
What are you talking about?

396
00:23:32,520 --> 00:23:33,950
Of course not.

397
00:23:35,650 --> 00:23:37,320
How could things get this far...

398
00:23:39,590 --> 00:23:41,530
with only me not knowing?

399
00:23:43,790 --> 00:23:45,800
I'm the chairman of Adele Group now.

400
00:23:45,860 --> 00:23:47,760
You should've discussed everything
with me.

401
00:23:48,600 --> 00:23:49,670
Don't you ever...

402
00:23:50,600 --> 00:23:52,400
do anything behind my back again.

403
00:23:58,340 --> 00:23:59,580
All right.

404
00:24:00,010 --> 00:24:01,750
If you're going to be the chairman
of Adele Group,

405
00:24:01,810 --> 00:24:03,950
you need to have
this kind of backbone.

406
00:24:05,150 --> 00:24:06,820
From now on,

407
00:24:07,420 --> 00:24:08,850
consult with Hyun Jun on everything.

408
00:24:09,520 --> 00:24:14,320
Of course.
We must consult with our Hyun Jun.

409
00:24:15,590 --> 00:24:19,030
Then should we discuss
our marriage as well?

410
00:24:20,300 --> 00:24:22,100
You can wait.

411
00:24:22,800 --> 00:24:24,630
The inauguration ceremony
comes first.

412
00:24:34,610 --> 00:24:37,150
My son is now the chairman.

413
00:24:37,950 --> 00:24:40,720
Finally, I, Oh Jung Ran,
have devoted my entire life...

414
00:24:41,380 --> 00:24:43,620
to paving a brilliant path
for my son.

415
00:24:44,690 --> 00:24:46,620
This heartless world,

416
00:24:46,720 --> 00:24:48,990
and that venomous
and tenacious Kim Dan Hui.

417
00:24:49,060 --> 00:24:50,730
I've defeated them all.

418
00:24:54,970 --> 00:24:57,430
I told you no killing.

419
00:24:58,000 --> 00:25:00,900
Choi Yu Na did it herself this time.

420
00:25:00,970 --> 00:25:02,270
You call that an excuse?

421
00:25:02,710 --> 00:25:04,170
Planning to kill someone,

422
00:25:04,170 --> 00:25:05,540
then arguing about
whether you succeeded.

423
00:25:05,610 --> 00:25:06,810
Does that sound normal to you?

424
00:25:07,680 --> 00:25:09,310
Do you think it was easy for me?

425
00:25:09,550 --> 00:25:11,580
It's not like I enjoyed doing it.

426
00:25:11,680 --> 00:25:14,750
It was hard, but I endured it.
I fought tooth and nail to get here.

427
00:25:15,250 --> 00:25:18,120
I was only trying to remove
anything in your way.

428
00:25:18,520 --> 00:25:19,790
You did it for me again?

429
00:25:20,860 --> 00:25:23,730
Of course.
I'm the source of this mess.

430
00:25:23,730 --> 00:25:25,160
We've come so far.

431
00:25:25,530 --> 00:25:27,900
You have the chairmanship
you wanted so badly.

432
00:25:28,730 --> 00:25:30,530
If you got the result you wanted,

433
00:25:30,900 --> 00:25:33,200
just let this one slide. Okay?

434
00:25:35,040 --> 00:25:36,840
You're saying this is...

435
00:25:39,680 --> 00:25:40,680
what I wanted?

436
00:25:54,190 --> 00:25:55,630
Choi Yu Na!

437
00:25:59,800 --> 00:26:01,100
What are you doing?

438
00:26:01,160 --> 00:26:03,600
You're the one
the police should be questioning.

439
00:26:04,700 --> 00:26:08,740
I'm going to tell them what you did
and clear Jin Ju's name.

440
00:26:10,970 --> 00:26:12,610
Do you have any proof I did it?

441
00:26:13,180 --> 00:26:15,180
Like you can do anything
without any evidence.

442
00:26:16,380 --> 00:26:20,450
The police said Baek Jin Ju's prints
were on the hammer.

443
00:26:21,020 --> 00:26:23,990
The person who tried to kill
Deputy Chief Yun was Baek Jin Ju.

444
00:26:33,360 --> 00:26:34,530
(Audio File 001)

445
00:26:36,130 --> 00:26:37,200
The hammer?

446
00:26:38,740 --> 00:26:41,540
Neither the police nor I
mentioned the weapon,

447
00:26:41,810 --> 00:26:43,270
so how'd you know about it?

448
00:26:45,140 --> 00:26:47,310
You'll have to explain that
to the police.

449
00:27:00,520 --> 00:27:01,730
Why are you just leaving?

450
00:27:06,000 --> 00:27:07,200
Shouldn't you be throwing a punch...

451
00:27:07,800 --> 00:27:09,670
or taking out your anger on me?

452
00:27:11,870 --> 00:27:13,600
Jin Ju's locked up.

453
00:27:13,600 --> 00:27:17,110
I need to get Jin Ju out
as quickly as possible,

454
00:27:17,510 --> 00:27:19,980
so I don't have time
to fight with a guy like you.

455
00:27:32,660 --> 00:27:36,890
(Chairman Park Hyun Jun)

456
00:27:41,460 --> 00:27:43,900
"Chairman Park Hyun Jun."

457
00:27:47,340 --> 00:27:49,910
I finally have it in my hands.

458
00:27:51,980 --> 00:27:53,040
But is this really...

459
00:27:55,150 --> 00:27:56,910
what I wanted?

460
00:28:09,190 --> 00:28:10,190
What now?

461
00:28:10,930 --> 00:28:13,400
Now that I've landed
this pathetic chairman's position,

462
00:28:13,930 --> 00:28:15,530
are you here to congratulate me?

463
00:28:15,530 --> 00:28:16,900
The attempt
on Deputy Chief Yun's life...

464
00:28:17,900 --> 00:28:19,540
Was it your mother and Choi Yu Na?

465
00:28:20,740 --> 00:28:22,240
It was to protect your secret...

466
00:28:22,310 --> 00:28:25,140
and get you the chairmanship.

467
00:28:25,210 --> 00:28:28,680
If you're curious, go ask my mother.
Why are you asking me?

468
00:28:28,680 --> 00:28:29,880
What are you going to do?

469
00:28:30,950 --> 00:28:32,580
You know everything your mother did,

470
00:28:33,280 --> 00:28:36,150
and you even saw
Baek Jin Ju get arrested.

471
00:28:37,590 --> 00:28:38,790
What are you going to do about it?

472
00:28:42,660 --> 00:28:46,260
Are you going to hesitate
wondering what you can do,

473
00:28:46,630 --> 00:28:49,070
look away, do nothing,

474
00:28:49,970 --> 00:28:51,770
and live like a nobody like me?

475
00:28:56,240 --> 00:28:59,310
Because I'm just a worthless guy,

476
00:28:59,910 --> 00:29:03,510
I've always hesitated
and never did anything.

477
00:29:04,850 --> 00:29:07,550
I couldn't stop your mother
from hurting people.

478
00:29:09,390 --> 00:29:12,520
Even though I knew you were
going down the wrong path...

479
00:29:14,690 --> 00:29:16,630
But I can't just stand by
any longer.

480
00:29:23,800 --> 00:29:27,070
Since words won't work with you,
I'm forced to do this.

481
00:29:29,140 --> 00:29:33,540
As precious as you are to me,
I had to lay a hand on my own son...

482
00:29:35,450 --> 00:29:36,480
to teach you that this is wrong...

483
00:29:37,850 --> 00:29:41,050
and to bring you back
to your senses.

484
00:29:41,580 --> 00:29:43,020
No matter how pathetic I am,

485
00:29:43,590 --> 00:29:45,960
I have to teach my child
when they do something wrong.

486
00:29:52,460 --> 00:29:53,800
Who says I'm your child?

487
00:29:56,030 --> 00:29:57,930
Why are you suddenly meddling
in my life?

488
00:29:58,800 --> 00:30:01,870
I've just become the chairman
of Adele Group, darn it!

489
00:30:05,540 --> 00:30:07,240
I've already come this far.

490
00:30:08,240 --> 00:30:09,810
What do you expect me to do?

491
00:30:10,050 --> 00:30:12,980
If you're on the wrong path,
you have to turn around.

492
00:30:14,880 --> 00:30:18,590
Was it really
the chairmanship you wanted?

493
00:30:19,220 --> 00:30:21,160
Is this really the right path?

494
00:30:22,330 --> 00:30:23,960
Now that you have it,

495
00:30:25,900 --> 00:30:28,030
surely you must know by now.

496
00:31:06,740 --> 00:31:08,040
How does it feel to be the chairman?

497
00:31:09,940 --> 00:31:11,210
Do you feel proud,

498
00:31:12,140 --> 00:31:13,540
like you've been hoping for?

499
00:31:15,710 --> 00:31:16,710
It's not enough.

500
00:31:19,850 --> 00:31:21,820
Just being chairman isn't enough...

501
00:31:25,190 --> 00:31:26,760
to make me feel proud.

502
00:31:28,790 --> 00:31:29,790
What?

503
00:32:03,630 --> 00:32:06,500
(Pearl in Red)

504
00:32:06,760 --> 00:32:08,000
So you're choosing
to keep that seat?

505
00:32:08,100 --> 00:32:10,170
Even when the woman you love
has been wrongly arrested,

506
00:32:10,230 --> 00:32:11,270
you're choosing to look away?

507
00:32:11,530 --> 00:32:13,900
You should be saving
the woman you love right now.

508
00:32:14,000 --> 00:32:16,770
I guess Park Min Jun
will take care of Baek Jin Ju.

509
00:32:16,840 --> 00:32:18,540
There's no reason for me
to be concerned anymore.

510
00:32:18,570 --> 00:32:21,080
Please start planning the wedding
so we can get married...

511
00:32:21,080 --> 00:32:22,110
right after the inauguration.

512
00:32:22,210 --> 00:32:25,450
I've earned the right
to request that much, haven't I?

513
00:32:25,680 --> 00:32:29,120
That Kim Dan Hui.
She never lets anything slide.

514
00:32:29,350 --> 00:32:31,390
If I give Choi Yu Na up
and reveal her crime,

515
00:32:31,520 --> 00:32:33,720
could that shut Kim Dan Hui up?

516
00:32:35,220 --> 00:32:37,230
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
